# .gitignore for Traditional Restaurant PHP Project with XAMPP
# Setup: Abdulhamid Alaboud & Ahmed Alaglan

### System Files ###
# macOS
.DS_Store
# Windows
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

### IDE Files ###
.vscode/
.idea/

### PHP Temporary Files ###
*.cache
*.tmp
sess_*

### Environment Files ###
.env
*.local

### XAMPP Directories (Important!) ###
/xampp/
/logs/
/mysql/data/

### Project Temporary Files ###
/tmp/
/uploads/
*.log

### Keep the images directory ###
!/images/
